QR Code management

The existing Owner Page must receive a QR management section.

Owner can:

- Upload a new QR Code image.
- Select an image from the phone gallery.
- Select a file from device storage.
- Preview the uploaded image.
- Replace the previous QR Code.
- Remove the QR Code.
- Save the new QR Code.

The latest active QR Code must appear on the payment page.

If no QR Code is configured, show a proper payment-unavailable message rather than displaying a broken image.

Payment verification workflow

The payment process must be:

1. Student selects a plan.
2. Student enters the required information.
3. Backend calculates the actual payable amount.
4. Student scans the displayed QR Code.
5. Student transfers the payment.
6. Student submits the payment request.
7. System generates a unique Payment Request ID.
8. Request status becomes Pending Verification.
9. Owner checks the actual incoming transaction in their bank or Google Pay records.
10. Owner verifies the real received amount and transaction.
11. Owner approves or rejects the payment.
12. On approval, Premium activates automatically.

Critical payment security

Never trust only:

- A submitted UTR number.
- A transaction screenshot.
- An uploaded receipt.
- A user-entered amount.
- A browser-side payment status.

A fake UTR must never activate Premium.

A student selecting ₹199 must not be able to pay ₹1 and obtain a ₹199 subscription.

The amount must be calculated and verified server-side.

For example:

Selected plan: ₹199.

Actual received amount: ₹1.

Result: Payment remains unverified. Premium must not activate.

Where a genuine payment gateway or reliable payment verification integration is available, support verified server-side webhooks. Otherwise, retain the manual verification workflow described above.

Do not claim that an ordinary QR image automatically verifies bank credits.

Payment waiting message

After submitting the payment request, show:

"Your payment request has been submitted successfully.

Your payment is currently waiting for verification.

Premium activation may take up to 12–24 hours.

Once your payment is verified, your Premium access will be activated and you will receive a notification.

Thank you for choosing AarohAI."

If verification is completed earlier, activate access immediately.

